    "title": "Weekend Console Download Deals for Sept. 25: Last chance for Nintendo Customer Appreciation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ozzie Mejia ,\n1 days ago If you missed it over the last few weeks, Nintendo has been offering substantial discounts on its first-party Switch library with the Customer Appreciation Sale. These are games that don't go on sale very often, because that's just how Nintendo operates. So if you're looking for some discounts on major first-party franchises like The Legend of Zelda, Mario, and Kirby, this is your last chance, because this sale ends this weekend. Read full article",
